sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Investor
    participant Client as Next.js Marketplace UI
    participant Server as Next.js Server Action
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Transaction

    Investor->>Client: Commit Capital ($500)
    Client->>Server: executeInvestment(loanId, $500)
    Server->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION (prisma.$transaction)
    Server->>DB: SELECT * FROM Loan WHERE id = loanId FOR UPDATE
    Note over DB: Pessimistic Row Lock Acquired
    Server->>DB: Check Wallet Balance >= $500 & Funded + $500 <= Target
    alt Validation Passed
        Server->>DB: UPDATE Wallet SET availableBalance -= 500, escrowBalance += 500
        Server->>DB: INSERT INTO Investment (amount, ownershipRatio)
        Server->>DB: UPDATE Loan SET fundedAmount += 500
        alt Campaign Reaches 100% Target
            Server->>DB: UPDATE Loan SET status = 'ACTIVE'
            Server->>DB: Disburse Escrow Funds -> Borrower Wallet
            Server->>DB: GENERATE RepaymentSchedule Items
        end
        Server->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
        DB-->>Server: Transaction Complete
        Server-->>Client: Investment Success
    else Validation Failed / Overfunded
        Server->>DB: ROLLBACK TRANSACTION
        Server-->>Client: Investment Failed Error
    end